  "operator_note": "Delay-tolerant PI: no tuning needed. Expect slower initial climb in delayed plant (20-40s to band) but no 0.9 hits. Nominal plant still reaches band in ~20s. Safety caps at 0.75/0.80 remain. If level sits <0.5 for >30s with u~0.52, check pump; controller is waiting for deadtime, do not switch to manual.",
